Signal Hawk Pro – User Guide

Version: 2.0
Application: Signal Hawk Pro


 1. System Requirements

    Minimum Requirements

 Windows 10 or Windows 11 (64-bit recommended)
 MetaTrader 5 installed
 Active internet connection
 Valid SignalHawk subscription

  Optional

  Multiple MT5 accounts for account management
  Telegram access for support and announcements



  2. Installation

1. Download the SignalHawk Pro executable from the official source.
2. Place the application in a folder with read/write permissions.
3. Ensure MetaTrader 5 is installed and functioning correctly.
4. Launch SignalHawk Pro.

  Security Notice

SignalHawk Pro contains built-in integrity protection.

If application files are modified, corrupted, or tampered with, the software may refuse to run for security reasons.



 3. Subscription Activation

On first launch, the system will request your registered email address.

If no active subscription exists:

1. Payment instructions will be displayed.
2. Send payment using Airtel Money.
3. Enter the Airtel Transaction ID (TID).
4. The transaction is submitted for admin verification.
5. Once approved, the application unlocks automatically.

 Airtel Payment Details

Number: 0748244415
Name: Semakula Sharif



 4. Subscription Management

The subscription status bar displays:

  Remaining subscription time
  Approval status
  Expiration status

   Features

  Real-time countdown timer
  Automatic expiry detection
  Automatic account lock when expired
  Automatic unlock after renewal approval

When a subscription expires:

  Trading stops automatically
  Bot controls are disabled
  Renewal instructions are displayed



  5. MetaTrader 5 Login

Enter:

  MT5 Login ID
  MT5 Password
  Broker Server

Click:  Login.

After successful login:

  Account credentials are encrypted locally
  Auto-login is available on future launches
  Login information can be synchronized to your cloud account

   Security

Credentials are encrypted before storage and are never displayed in plain text.



  6. Account Management

Select Manage Accounts to access saved trading accounts.

Features include:

  Save multiple MT5 accounts
  Load accounts instantly
  Cloud account synchronization
  Fast account switching
  Automatic retrieval of previously saved accounts



  7. Broker Hub

Click Broker Hub to access broker resources and trading services.

The Broker Hub provides:

  Broker information
  Trading resources
  Additional services integrated into SignalHawk Pro



  8. Symbol Selection

Supported trading instruments are grouped into categories.

  Metals

  XAUUSDm
  XAUUSDm

 Cryptocurrency

  BTCUSDm
  ETHUSDm

  Forex

  EURUSDm
  GBPUSDm
  EURJPYm
  GBPJPYm

  Indices

  USTECm
  USOILm

  Controls

  Select Symbols
  Select All
  Clear All

The selected instruments appear below the selection menu.



  9. Trading Settings

Configure:

   Scan Interval

Available options:

  1 Minute
  5 Minutes
  15 Minutes
  1 Hour

   Maximum Active Symbols

Limits how many symbols can trade simultaneously.

   Lot Modes

   Auto Risk

Automatically calculates lot size.

    Fixed Lot

Choose a fixed lot size:

  0.01
  0.05
  0.10
  0.20
  1.00



  10. Bot Controls

  START BOT

Starts automated trading using selected settings.

Requirements:

  Active subscription
  Successful MT5 login
  At least one selected symbol

   STOP BOT

Immediately stops trading operations.

  Toggle Dark/Light Mode

Switches between dark and light user interface themes.

   Monitor Trades

Opens the Live Position Monitor window.



  11. Live Position Monitor

The Position Monitor provides real-time visibility of all open trades.

Displayed information includes:

  Ticket Number
  Symbol
  Buy/Sell Direction
  Current Profit/Loss
  Entry Price
  Current Price
  Stop Loss
  Take Profit

   Trade Management Actions

     Close Selected

Closes the currently selected position.

    Close Profitable

Closes all positions currently in profit.

    Close Losing

Closes all losing positions.

      Close All

Closes every open position.

    Cooldown Protection

When a losing trade is manually closed, SignalHawk can apply a cooldown period to prevent immediate re-entry on that symbol.



  12. Announcement System

SignalHawk includes a live announcement system.

Administrators can send:

  Updates
  Maintenance notices
  Important alerts
  Trading information

Announcements automatically appear inside the application.

Each announcement is shown only once per user.



  13. Activity Monitoring

SignalHawk automatically reports:

  Online status
  Offline status
  Last activity timestamp

This helps maintain accurate subscription and account status.



  14. Logging System

The log panel records system activity in real time.

Examples include:

  Login success
  Subscription updates
  Trade actions
  Bot activity
  Error notifications
  Approval confirmations

Each log entry contains a timestamp.



  15. Security Features

SignalHawk Pro includes:

    Subscription Protection

Trading cannot start without a valid subscription.

     Account Encryption

Stored MT5 credentials are encrypted.

     Integrity Verification

Application tampering detection.

   Secure Cloud Storage

Account synchronization through Firebase.

    Automatic Access Locking

Expired subscriptions immediately disable trading functions.



  16. Troubleshooting

   "Subscription Required"

Your subscription is inactive, expired, or pending approval.

    "Login Failed"

Verify:

  MT5 Login ID
  Password
  Server Name

   "Waiting for Admin Approval"

Your payment has been received but has not yet been approved.

    "Offline"

Check your internet connection and firewall settings.



  17. Risk Disclaimer

SignalHawk Pro is an automated trading assistant.

Trading financial instruments involves significant risk and may result in financial losses.

Past performance does not guarantee future results.

The developer and distributors of SignalHawk Pro are not responsible for losses incurred through the use of this software.

Use at your own risk.

 

